        <mxCell id="bshJnAdmZ42-ucYETjzj-63" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;b&gt;VERIFY INITIAL STATE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;1.&lt;/b&gt; Verify the MTProofs that prove that the first leafs of the tree store the public parameters of the voting process:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; 0x0 = &lt;b&gt;processID&lt;/b&gt;, 0x1 = &lt;b&gt;censusRoot&lt;/b&gt;, 0x2 = &lt;b&gt;ballotMode&lt;/b&gt;, 0x3 = &lt;b&gt;EPK&lt;/b&gt;, 0x4 = &lt;b&gt;resultsAdd^{old}&lt;/b&gt;, 0x5 = &lt;b&gt;resultsAdd^{sub}&lt;/b&gt;. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;2.&lt;/b&gt; Verify the MTProofs that prove that none of the &lt;b&gt;voteIDs&lt;/b&gt; belong to the tree.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;3.&lt;/b&gt; Verify the MTProofs of each &lt;b&gt;address&lt;/b&gt;:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; - If it is an inclusion proof: consider the vote &lt;b&gt;(c1, c2)&lt;/b&gt; an &lt;b&gt;overwrite&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; - If it is a non-inclusion proof: consider the vote &lt;b&gt;(c1, c2)&lt;/b&gt; a &lt;b&gt;newVote&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontFamily=Courier New;" vertex="1" parent="bshJnAdmZ42-ucYETjzj-1">
